## Working style

- Small HTML/CSS changes; preview with `npx serve .` if helpful.
- After edits, confirm `index.html` still references only files that exist in the folder (or that the user will add).
- Summarize what changed before suggesting Vercel redeploy.
- Do not invent Vercel or GitHub credentials — ask the human to deploy or connect the repo.
